{"savedAt":"2026-11-04T18:46:23.592Z","id":"f030afdf-f333-4e8c-8153-bfb0242e0bbc","slug":"how-to-get-a-rental-agreement-online-in-india","title":"How to Get a Rental Agreement Online in India","excerpt":"In today’s digital world, almost everything—from groceries to government services—is just a click away. So why should creating a rent...","seoData":{"tags":[],"settings":{"preventAutoRedirect":false,"keywords":[]}},"richContent":{"nodes":[{"type":"IMAGE","id":"am8ug13670","nodes":[],"imageData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"image":{"src":{"id":"b597e1_bf118c7c92234e92a9a3809a9d09a88f~mv2.png"},"width":1536,"height":1024}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"imyer13395","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"In today’s digital world, almost everything—from groceries to government services—is just a click away. So why should creating a rent agreement still feel like an offline task from the 90s?","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"l7mxr349","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"If you’re renting a flat or giving one out, you don’t need to hunt for a notary or stand in line at a registrar’s office anymore. Thanks to verified online platforms, getting a rental agreement online in India is now legal, fast, and super convenient.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"gwgx0355","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"In this guide, I’ll walk you through the step-by-step process, what documents you need, how much stamp duty you’ll pay (because yes, it varies state to state), and exactly what to expect when going the digital route.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"upkdn3105","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"HEADING","id":"ayc67357","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"First, Why Does a Rent Agreement Even Matter?","decorations":[]}}],"headingData":{"level":2,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"649mc359","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"6pzdq3236","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Let’s be honest—many renters skip this document or treat it like just another formality. But here’s the truth:","decorations":[]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"\n","decorations":[]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"A rent agreement isn’t just a piece of paper. It’s your proof of rights, responsibilities, and protection—for both the tenant and the landlord.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"mjda1366","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Whether you’re applying for a passport, getting police verification, or even just ensuring your security deposit is safe, a proper rent agreement is non-negotiable.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"047wz3370","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"HEADING","id":"jxiah370","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Can You Legally Get a Rent Agreement Online in India?","decorations":[]}}],"headingData":{"level":2,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"lgrs1372","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"yqw2g4671","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Absolutely, yes. In most Indian states, especially urban ones like Maharashtra, Karnataka, Delhi, Tamil Nadu, and Telangana, digital rent agreements are fully recognized. You can now:","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"t